{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5a961d33a4364605","type":"group","x":820,"y":-560,"width":660,"height":560,"label":"CPU"},
		{"id":"28252d51a4970bfd","type":"group","x":1960,"y":-560,"width":660,"height":560,"label":"RAM"},
		{"id":"ef6c58fd17203591","type":"text","text":"**RAM**","x":-360,"y":-300,"width":100,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{
			"id":"045636a8821cce18",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- **RAM holds the data:** When you open a program, the operating system carves out space in RAM for its stack, heap, and code. Every spot in RAM has a numbered address, just like houses on a street.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1000,
			"y":-528,
			"width":500,
			"height":117
		},
		{
			"id":"0a3ec296395b33de",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Heap",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-640,
			"y":-110,
			"width":86,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"99e39b8d41026c65",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Stack",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-940,
			"y":-110,
			"width":89,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f719599e95b44f81",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"RAM = Memory\n\nThis is where memory management occurs",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-416,
			"y":-707,
			"width":212,
			"height":105
		},
		{
			"id":"2ad68397d80d96ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**CPU**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":460,
			"y":-300,
			"width":80,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"50535c71fbbe9ba8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The CPU stores a ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":-140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b0e6b60d14766d34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Cache",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":162,
			"y":-488,
			"width":116,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"37d9f4911c7d3c6b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CPU reaches into RAM, grabs a piece of data from a specific address, brings it into its own tiny internal workspace (registers/cache) to do a calculation, and sends the result back to RAM.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-113,
			"y":-329,
			"width":406,
			"height":118
		},
		{
			"id":"43be9f043c643f28",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Registers",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":162,
			"y":-737,
			"width":116,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"086bb0430c6028b1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Hold:\n- data\n- instructions\n- memory addresses\nthat the computer is actively using / processing NOW",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":382,
			"y":-974,
			"width":475,
			"height":174
		},
		{
			"id":"898e029bb33f0fca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Small, built-in, ultra-fast storage locations",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":382,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0d0b91d6cdedeccc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is what we're managing.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3200,
			"y":-640,
			"width":264,
			"height":60
		}
	],
